{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346520/extras/f401ee44379ed1233561b10615501950.avif?t=1771942898\" width=938 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346520/extras/5bb581a43e7cab558e427cfde6771b04.poster.avif?t=1771942898\" width=1116 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346520/extras/5bb581a43e7cab558e427cfde6771b04.webm?t=1771942898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346520/extras/5bb581a43e7cab558e427cfde6771b04.mp4?t=1771942898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two worlds, one nightmare. Step inside a brutal orphanage and uncover the dark secrets of Qu\u00e9bec\u2019s Great Darkness. Solve puzzles related to an inexplicable phenomenon and dive into the depths of dreams to uncover otherworldly horrors. An Abyss of Dreams is a cosmic horror point-and-click game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As the Great Darkness descends upon the province of Quebec, young Th\u00e9r\u00e8se\u2019s world collapses. Following her mother\u2019s death, she is sent to the Saint-Nicolas-de-la-Passion Orphanage, a place governed by brutality, silence, and unquestioned faith.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each night, Th\u00e9r\u00e8se slips into another realm. At first, it feels serene, almost beautiful, but beneath its dreamlike calm lurk unspeakable horrors. This world of dreams may hold the key to the disturbing events unfolding behind the orphanage\u2019s walls...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Abyss of Dreams</strong> is a 3D point-and-click cosmic horror game. Traverse two intertwined worlds, a grim orphanage and a haunting dreamscape, to uncover the source of the afflictions tormenting its children. Explore richly detailed environments, solve grounded yet surreal puzzles, and piece together a mystery. Experience a poignant, unsettling narrative that confronts the dark legacy of Quebec\u2019s Catholic institutions and the children left in their care.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3346520?t=1771942898","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3346520?t=1771942898","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346520/dea4ae02d28137c7c6b43596e5cad02db1889792/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771942898","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346520/dea4ae02d28137c7c6b43596e5cad02db1889792/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771942898","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Representation of graphic violence and blood."},"demos":[{"appid":4089130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346520/extras/f401ee44379ed1233561b10615501950.avif?t=1771942898\" width=938 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346520/extras/5bb581a43e7cab558e427cfde6771b04.poster.avif?t=1771942898\" width=1116 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346520/extras/5bb581a43e7cab558e427cfde6771b04.webm?t=1771942898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346520/extras/5bb581a43e7cab558e427cfde6771b04.mp4?t=1771942898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two worlds, one nightmare. Step inside a brutal orphanage and uncover the dark secrets of Qu\u00e9bec\u2019s Great Darkness. Solve puzzles related to an inexplicable phenomenon and dive into the depths of dreams to uncover otherworldly horrors. An Abyss of Dreams is a cosmic horror point-and-click game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As the Great Darkness descends upon the province of Quebec, young Th\u00e9r\u00e8se\u2019s world collapses. Following her mother\u2019s death, she is sent to the Saint-Nicolas-de-la-Passion Orphanage, a place governed by brutality, silence, and unquestioned faith.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each night, Th\u00e9r\u00e8se slips into another realm. At first, it feels serene, almost beautiful, but beneath its dreamlike calm lurk unspeakable horrors. This world of dreams may hold the key to the disturbing events unfolding behind the orphanage\u2019s walls...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Abyss of Dreams</strong> is a 3D point-and-click cosmic horror game. Traverse two intertwined worlds, a grim orphanage and a haunting dreamscape, to uncover the source of the afflictions tormenting its children. Explore richly detailed environments, solve grounded yet surreal puzzles, and piece together a mystery. Experience a poignant, unsettling narrative that confronts the dark legacy of Quebec\u2019s Catholic institutions and the children left in their care.</p>","developers":["Studio Chien d'Or"],"dlc":[4423300],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346520/a07d7988812edac5d8ceaaa86eba5e982cd32b1c/header.jpg?t=1771942898","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3346520/1